ideo/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Build anything in a voxel sandbox using hundreds of beautiful blocks and dynamic lights</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Summon friendly bubblebears, noots and fruit femmes to fill the void </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Share your creations with other dreamers in the firmament </p></li></ul>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel® Core™ i3-8130U<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel UHD Graphics 620 <br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1100 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Requires Vulkan support. Systems without Vulkan will experience crashes and severe graphical glitches.</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>","genres":["Action","Adventure","Indie","RPG"],"developers":["Lucy B. Locks"],"publishers":["Lucy B. Locks"],"release_date":"12 Mar, 2026"}